This should be (this is my first attempt at doing this) the
arc'd then uuencoded form of the MS-Dos text editor I gave
rave reviews for in comp.sys.ibm.pc, QEDIT.

I had to split this into 3 parts.  save all three, then edit
the headers out of them.  Combine the three in order 
( cat part1 part2 part3 > qedit.uue ).  Then you can uudecode
qedit.uue, download, un-ARC and have fun.

-steven j. vore
stevenj@umbc3.umd.edu

(ps - like i said, it's my first time.  if i messed up, please
      let me know.  nicely, though, eh?)

